# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime license store
#
# SECURITY: this file holds LIVE license keys. It was previously committed to
# this public repository, which published two active "lifetime" keys. It must
# never be committed again.
#
# The app recreates the file (empty) on first run, so removing it from version
# control is safe. Seed it on the server instead, or mint a key through the
# admin panel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/api-server/data/licenses.json

